{
    "word": "chinstrap",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7a8211f5-e7f8-3253-9c4a-4aeb9da19b35",
                "word": "chinstrap",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "d5658145-a1d1-4b86-bb4e-8d99b972130b",
                        "entry_id": "7a8211f5-e7f8-3253-9c4a-4aeb9da19b35",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chinstraps"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2130601f-9d8a-3cf6-861d-b0f70cd23526",
                        "entry_id": "7a8211f5-e7f8-3253-9c4a-4aeb9da19b35",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A strip of leather or material used to fasten a hat or helmet under the chin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f49ad95c-f1ca-4f03-aecd-3d16c77bcfae",
                                "sense_id": "2130601f-9d8a-3cf6-861d-b0f70cd23526",
                                "text": "A bridle, the chin-strap or chain."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a5deaf22-93eb-44fd-a311-78976cdfb387",
                                "sense_id": "2130601f-9d8a-3cf6-861d-b0f70cd23526",
                                "text": "Such a deficit was not likely long to escape notice: the regiment was halted in the midst of a manœuvre, and, in the pause that ensued, Nosey demanded, in a grunt of thunder, how, without a chinstrap, I could expect my cap to stick upon my head."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f86865ab-fdc6-47f3-b4d8-49988e2ef1cf",
                                "sense_id": "2130601f-9d8a-3cf6-861d-b0f70cd23526",
                                "text": "I immediately spat my mouthpiece out and unbuckled my chinstrap, yanking my helmet off of my head in a determined flash."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "198d310a-5990-3a99-9a09-dd4e8201834d",
                        "entry_id": "7a8211f5-e7f8-3253-9c4a-4aeb9da19b35",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A form of beard that follows the jawline but does not cover the rest of the chin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "af6e7264-d592-334a-8927-462ee738c3ca",
                        "entry_id": "7a8211f5-e7f8-3253-9c4a-4aeb9da19b35",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A band of colour below a bird's mouth, resembling the chinstrap of a helmet."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "43f7e40c-7b75-4608-b2cf-dc109da12396",
                                "sense_id": "af6e7264-d592-334a-8927-462ee738c3ca",
                                "text": "A miniature look-alike of the Canada Goose, with a partial white necklace instead of a white chinstrap."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fd02cdc7-83a4-4f3e-a1f1-b0ce210b30c9",
                                "sense_id": "af6e7264-d592-334a-8927-462ee738c3ca",
                                "text": "The dark slate-grey plumage contrasting strongly with white 'chinstrap' is shared only by Blue Eared-pheasant, but their ranges do not overlap."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30060fa8-ced1-4eab-ac1a-8524839d93c7",
                        "source_entry_id": "7a8211f5-e7f8-3253-9c4a-4aeb9da19b35",
                        "source_sense_description": "strip used to fasten a hat or helmet under the chin",
                        "target_lang_word": "kinband",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "kinband",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20a6d529-9e66-3600-94f4-66fd382aae40",
                                        "entry_id": "777d3290-24e7-398e-b473-89c21cfdb341",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een strook stof of leer aan een hoofddeksel die onder de kin doorloopt met als doel dat hoofddeksel op zijn plaats te houden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cfc4811c-e8da-4166-8a11-247cc909406d",
                                                "sense_id": "20a6d529-9e66-3600-94f4-66fd382aae40",
                                                "text": "Maar er was nog veel meer dat tot grote, zo niet rampzalige gevolgen had kunnen leiden. Zo verloor de passagier na zijn lancering van de schietstoel zijn helm. Dat kon gebeuren doordat hij zijn kinband niet had vastgemaakt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0c9e1ca-7fa1-448d-8863-82b64ac277dc",
                                                "sense_id": "20a6d529-9e66-3600-94f4-66fd382aae40",
                                                "text": "Een van hen is de piloot, de Engelsman King Cole. Cole gaat na zijn landing ordelijk en overdacht te werk. Hij vouwt de parachute, een geel reddingsvlot en zijn gewatteerde leren vliegerscap met kinband netjes op en verstopt die in een sloot, in de hoop niet te worden ontdekt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6fcf3e3-f4bb-498a-951d-d117fba73848",
                                                "sense_id": "20a6d529-9e66-3600-94f4-66fd382aae40",
                                                "text": "De cap heeft een kinband zodat deze goed op het hoofd blijft zitten, en de meeste caps hebben aan de achterzijde een draai-klik-systeem waarmee de binnenband kan worden afgesteld, zodat deze goed op het hoofd past."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cc84fb43-8225-42f2-9fce-01efa58ae1a7",
